The source URDF and all 67 mesh files are copied byte-for-byte. provenance.json
records upstream paths and SHA-256 digests. No mesh or XML from the private RL
study is included in this directory. The source ROS package.xml has an unfinished
license field; the repository root LICENSE supplies BSD-3-Clause and no separate
asset-specific license was found in the inspected source tree.

Runtime adaptation, not modifications to the stored URDF: MuJoCo native importer;
30 wrist/finger joints fixed at zero; 27 other scalar joints retained; floating
root added; visual geometry retained; original inertials and collision shapes
imported. Named sole/palm sites, ground and 23 experimental position servos are
added by project code. Servo settings are not official model/hardware ratings.
The runtime stance adaptation removes mesh collision elements and retains only
the four original sole-pad boxes, keeping SN001 inertials unchanged. Unlike the
upstream Gazebo minContacts variant, no surrogate link inertias are substituted.
This adaptation has no self or body-ground collisions. A task must terminate on
falling before body-ground impact is expected. Stored source files are unchanged.
